msgid ""
"First-class native apps built for each platform, not web wrappers. Everything you love about NewsBlur, on "
"every device."
msgstr ""
"Erstklassige native Apps für jede Plattform – keine Web-Wrapper. Alles, was du an NewsBlur liebst, auf "
